when: 1947-12-01
where: [palestine]  # TODO(migration): matched from the title; verify
actors: [arab-liberation-army]  # auto-tagged from text: arab-liberation-army
---
## Arab irregulars of the volunteer Arab Liberation Army begin trickling into Palestine and begin attacking Jewish convoys.

---
id: 1947-12-18-15-palestinians-including-5-children
when: 1947-12-18
where: [khisas]  # TODO(migration): matched from the title; verify
actors: [palmach]  # auto-tagged from text: palmach
---
## 15 Palestinians, including 5 children, are kiled by Palmach special forces assaulting Khisas village.

The village has a few hundred Muslims and a hundred Christians. The Palmach attack at night and start blowing up houses while the occupants sleep. Ben Gurion later issues a public apology, but later still includes this in his list of successful operations.

