actors: [haganah, lehi]  # auto-tagged from text: haganah, lehi
---
## Haganah attacks a coffee shop in the village of Lifta; Stern Gang fires into a bus nearby.

The attack started when the Haganah had earlier killed a petrol station owner on a false allegation of inciting attack on Jews. Some villagers in Lifta retaliated by firing on a Jewish bus.

