id: 1947-12-31-haganah-kills-70-palestinian-villagers
when: 1947-12-31
where: [haifa, balad-al-sheikh]  # TODO(migration): matched from the title; verify
actors: [haganah, irgun]  # auto-tagged from text: haganah, irgun
---
## Haganah kills 70 Palestinian villagers in Balad al Sheikh, in relation to Haifa refinery attacks.

The inquiry committee set up by Jewish community in Haifa found the earlier Arab lynching was unpremedidated, and condemned Irgun for their initial attack. It still authorized a reliatory attack.

