---
id: 1948-02-18-haganah-sets-up-hemed-beit
when: 1948-02-18
actors: [haganah]  # auto-tagged from text: haganah
---
## Haganah sets up Hemed Beit, a special unit to explore chemical and biological warfare.

The unit is lead by Ephraim Katzir, who would later become the 4th President of Israel. They are responsible for poisoning water wells with Typhoid bacteria in Accre, Gaza, and Galilee.

---
id: 1948-02-19-ben-gurion-s-advisors-relay
when: 1948-02-19
where: [palestine]  # TODO(migration): matched from the title; verify
themes: [rhetoric-zionist]
---
## Ben Gurion's advisors relay that rural Palestine shows no wish to fight in the wake of attacks.

Ben Gurion says

>A small reaction [to Arab hostility] does not impress anyone. A destroyed house — nothing. Destroy a neighborhood, and you begin to make an impression!

He also says

>to continue to terrorize the rural areas ... through a series of offensives ... so that the same mood of passivity reported ... would prevail.

---
