---
## Deir Yassin Massacre

Over 93 Palestinian villagers killed by Irgun and Lehi forces. The attack was part of Plan Dalet/Operation Nachson to secure the road to Jerusalem.

---
id: 1948-04-09-multiple-palestinian-villages-destroyed-during
when: 1948-04-09
actors: [haganah]  # auto-tagged from text: haganah
---
## Multiple Palestinian villages destroyed during Operation Nachson.

Qastal, Qalunya, Saris, Beit Surik, and Biddu are among the villages captured and destroyed by Haganah forces. Haganah forces blow up houses and expel villagers.

---
id: 1948-04-18-the-village-of-tiberias-is
when: 1948-04-18
where: [tiberias]  # TODO(migration): matched from the title; verify
actors: [haganah, uk]  # auto-tagged from text: haganah, uk
---
## The village of Tiberias is captured and cleansed of Palestinians.

Haganah uses loudspeakers and barrel bombs to terrorize and expel the population. The British initially offered protection, but later negootiated a general evacuation.

---
id: 1948-04-22-haifa-cleansed-of-palestinians-in
