## Haifa cleansed of Palestinians in Operation Bi'ur Hametz (Cleansing the Leaven).

Haganah forces (Carmeli Brigade of 2000 soldiers) expel 50,000 Palestinians from Haifa, after the British Commander Hugh Stockwell withdraws buffer forces.

---
id: 1948-04-26-haganah-attacks-jerusalem
