## Haganah attacks Jerusalem

Haganah is forced to hand over East Jerusalem to the British. Haganah captures West Jerusalem and expells all Palestinians.

---
id: 1948-05-01-safad-is-cleansed-of-palestinians
when: 1948-05-01
where: [safad]  # TODO(migration): matched from the title; verify
actors: [palmach]  # auto-tagged from text: palmach
---
## Safad is cleansed of Palestinians by the Palmach special forces.

Safad had 9500 Arabs and 2400 Orthodox Jews, uninterested in Zionism. Defences are manned by 400 volunteers. 1000 Palmach soldiers besiege and expel Palestenians, only allowing a 100 old people to stay. They're expelled within the month.

---
